<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85119" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ-ξενος</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ-ξεινος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, poet. also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			122.1
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>N.</u>
			3.2
		</span></i>:—of persons, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>entertaining many guests, very hospitable,</i> opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄξεινος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				715
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαίς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				722
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυξενώτατον Ζῆνα τῶν κεκμηκότων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					157
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				228
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				478
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>visited by many guests,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωμός, νᾶσος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				1.93
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>N.</u>
				3.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεάνιδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					122.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					569
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); cf. sq.</div>
